DESCRIPTION:One category a day. Name something in it that nobody else has claimed. If you're first\, it's yours\, and your name goes on it for good. 3 claims a night. 5 strikes and you're out. Rarer answers score more. Taken or reserved answers cost a strike. Typos and answers not on the list never do. https://dibs.here/
